# The chests' 256 px hero renders (chest_*_hero.png, docs/art_direction.md §7.13) are drawn at 141–180 px from the kit's
# atlas (Kit.hero_rect / hero_still bake them at their size, sampling the mipmaps): their import settings
# (mipmaps/generate=true) are tracked, like the face crops' in ../portraits. The root .gitignore ignores *.import; the
# 128 px icons (default settings) stay ignored.
!chest_*_hero.png.import
